+### Compound Format
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })       // "1h30m"
+ms(90061000, { compound: true })      // "25h1m1s"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })      // "-1h30m"
+```
+
+The compound output can be read by Go's `time.ParseDuration`: the parts are not
+separated and hours are the largest unit. Leftover milliseconds are dropped.
+
